  "A community library of real industrial process cases modeled in DWSIM: crude distillation, hydrotreating, gas processing, separations and more. Double-click a case to download and open it.": "社区提供的 DWSIM 工业流程案例库，包含原油蒸馏、加氢处理、气体加工及分离等。双击案例即可下载并打开。",
  "FOSSEE, IIT Bombay, invites chemical engineering students, faculty and practitioners to the flowsheeting project using DWSIM. We want you to convert existing flowsheets into DWSIM and get honoraria and certificates.": "印度理工学院孟买分校 FOSSEE 项目邀请化工学生、教师和工程师参与 DWSIM 流程建模。将已有流程转换为 DWSIM 案例，可获得酬金和证书。",
  "The next steps walk through what a new simulation needs: the compounds, the reactions between them, the thermodynamic models, the system of units, and how the flowsheet behaves while you work.": "接下来将配置新模拟需要的组分、反应、热力学模型、单位制及流程图操作方式。",
  "Nothing here is exclusive to the wizard. Everything can be changed later in Simulation Settings, and every change you make is applied to the simulation as you make it, so you can close the wizard whenever you want.": "这些设置稍后均可在“模拟设置”中修改。向导中的修改立即生效，可随时关闭向导。",
