  "Enabling Inspector Reports will create model description and performance reports on-the-fly as the calculations are requested by the flowsheet solver. Use the Solution Inspector tool to view these reports.": "流程求解器请求计算时，实时生成模型说明和性能报告。可使用“求解诊断”工具查看。",
  "This will erase all previously stored reports when a new flowsheet calculation request is made.": "每次请求重新计算流程时，将清除此前保存的报告。",
  "Enables utilization of all CPU cores during flowsheet calculations. The Inspector is turned off while this is on.": "使用所有 CPU 核心并行计算流程。启用后将关闭求解诊断功能。",
  "If activated, the solver will not calculate the rest of the flowsheet when an error occurs during the calculation of an intermediate block.": "启用后，若中间单元计算出错，求解器将停止计算剩余流程。",
  "Compound datasets are read when the application starts. XML datasets and single compound JSON files are both accepted.": "启动程序时读取组分数据集，支持 XML 数据集和单组分 JSON 文件。",
  "Backup copies are written while a simulation is open. Purging deletes every file in the folder above.": "模拟打开期间定时写入备份。“清空”会删除上述文件夹中的所有文件。",
  "Set the path of the Python 3.x dynamic library to enable integration with DWSIM. Restart DWSIM for the change to take effect.": "设置 Python 3.x 动态库路径，以启用 DWSIM 集成。重启 DWSIM 后生效。",
  "Scales the whole interface - fonts, controls and menu icons. For example, 1.25 makes everything 25% larger. Takes effect the next time the application starts.": "缩放整个界面的字体、控件和菜单图标。例如 1.25 表示放大 25%。下次启动程序时生效。",
  "Pick the compounds the simulation works with. Use the search box to find them by name, CAS number, formula or database.": "选择模拟使用的组分。可按名称、CAS 号、分子式或数据库搜索。",
  "Set up the reactions between the compounds you added. A simulation without reactors does not need any.": "设置已添加组分之间的反应。不含反应器的模拟无需配置反应。",
  "Add the thermodynamic models the simulation calculates with. The first one on the list is the default for new objects.": "添加模拟计算使用的热力学模型。列表中的第一个物性包将用于新建对象。",
  "Choose the units the simulation is shown in. You can create your own set from any of the built-in ones.": "选择模拟显示使用的单位制。可基于内置单位制创建自定义单位制。",
  "Objects are edited with a single click by default. Turn this on to open the editor only when the object is double-clicked.": "默认单击对象即可编辑。启用后，双击对象才会打开编辑器。",
  "DWSIM can skip the calculation of a flowsheet object when none of its input parameters, including the inlet streams, has changed since the last run.": "若某对象的输入参数（包括入口流股）自上次运行后均未改变，DWSIM 可跳过该对象的计算。",
  "If the selected equilibrium calculation method fails, DWSIM can try again with a simple vapor-liquid procedure. This is applied to every property package of the simulation.": "所选相平衡方法失败时，DWSIM 可尝试简单气液平衡算法。此设置适用于模拟中的所有物性包。",
  "Undo and redo are turned off by default because recording every change costs memory and makes large simulations slower to edit.": "默认关闭撤销和重做，因为记录每次修改会占用内存，并降低大型模拟的编辑速度。",
  "The name identifies the simulation on reports and is suggested as the file name when it is saved.": "此名称用于报告中标识模拟，并在保存时作为建议文件名。",
